    {
      "name": "dashboard_index_glossary",
      "displayName": "Index & Glossary",
      "pageType": "PAGE_TYPE_CANVAS",
      "layoutVersion": "GRID_V1",
      "layout": [
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "glossary_title",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "# Index & Glossary"
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "glossary_intro",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "Use this page as the dashboard index. It explains every metric, visual, filter, and source dataset used across the Banking dashboard."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 1,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "glossary_page_index",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Page Index\n\n- Page 1: Overview - portfolio-wide banking KPIs, transaction trends, loan status mix, and AUM trend.\n- Page 2: Customer & Branch Deep-Dive - segment contribution, product holding mix, top customers, and branch loan portfolio.\n- Page 3: Index & Glossary - definitions for all filters, metrics, visuals, and datasets."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 3,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 4
          }
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "glossary_filters",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Filters\n\n- Transaction date: Date range filter applied to transaction, loan, balance, and holding date fields where available.\n- Customer segment: Multi-select filter for customer segment across transaction, loan, balance, and holding datasets.\n- Channel type: Multi-select filter for transaction channel type, such as Digital or branch-assisted channels."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 7,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 4
          }
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "glossary_kpis",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## KPI Glossary\n\n- Total txn value: Sum of total transaction value from transactions overview, displayed in INR.\n- Transaction success rate: Successful transaction count divided by total transaction count.\n- Digital txn rate: Digital transaction count divided by total transaction count.\n- Avg ticket size: Total transaction value divided by transaction count.\n- Avg products per customer: Distinct product holdings divided by distinct customers in holdings data.\n- Gross NPA ratio: NPA outstanding divided by total outstanding principal.\n- Total AUM latest month: Closing balance for the latest available month-end.\n- Loan book outstanding: Sum of total outstanding principal from loans overview."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 11,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 8
          }
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "glossary_visuals_overview",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Visual Glossary - Overview\n\n- Transaction value by channel: Bar chart comparing transaction value by channel name and channel type.\n- Loan portfolio by status: Pie chart showing total outstanding principal by loan status.\n- AUM trend - monthly closing balance: Line chart tracking closing balance by month-end date."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 19,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 4
          }
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "glossary_visuals_deep_dive",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Visual Glossary - Customer & Branch Deep-Dive\n\n- Txn value by customer segment: Pie chart showing transaction value distribution by customer segment.\n- Holdings value by product type: Bar chart comparing product holding value by product type, shown in lakhs.\n- Top 10 customers: Table listing customers with transaction count, total value, average ticket, and share of total.\n- Branch loan portfolio: Table ranking branches by loan count, disbursement, outstanding principal, and NPA loan count."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 23,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 5
          }
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "glossary_dataset_sources",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Source Dataset Index\n\n- ds_transactions_overview: Transaction date, customer segment, channel type/name, transaction value, transaction counts, success counts, digital counts, and value in lakhs.\n- ds_loans_overview: Disbursement date, customer segment, loan status, branch, loan counts, NPA counts, disbursement, outstanding principal, and NPA outstanding.\n- ds_gross_npa_ratio_kpi: Dedicated KPI dataset for gross NPA ratio.\n- ds_balances_overview: Month-end balance data, total closing balance, and latest-month closing balance.\n- ds_holdings_kpi_raw: Raw holding and customer grain for average products per customer.\n- ds_txn_value_by_segment: Transaction value summarized by customer segment.\n- ds_holdings_by_product_type: Holding value summarized by product type.\n- ds_top_customers: Top 10 customers by transaction value with average ticket and share of total.\n- ds_branch_loan_portfolio: Top branch loan portfolio summary by disbursement."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 28,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 9
          }
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "glossary_units_notes",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Units and Reading Notes\n\n- Currency values are displayed in INR unless the visual label explicitly says lakhs.\n- Percentage metrics are ratios rendered as percentages.\n- Lakhs are calculated as raw value divided by 100,000.\n- Latest-month AUM uses the maximum month_end_date available in the balance dataset.\n- Tables are pre-ranked in their source datasets and currently display the top 10 records."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 37,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 5
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
